# Environment variables for the open Office Management UI prototype.
BASE_PATH=/

# Office prototype uses only local demo entry: username admin, password optional.
# No Office officer Auth or private SQL credentials are configured in this frontend.

# Protected Audit SQL integration (not active in public prototype builds).
# Set these through the protected release environment only AFTER Office
# Supabase Auth and active officer membership are independently verified.
# These are PUBLIC client settings; NEVER use a service_role or secret key.
# Shared mode strictly fails closed if any credential/membership is missing.
# VITE_AUDIT_DATA_MODE=shared
# VITE_OFFICE_SUPABASE_URL=https://<authorized-office-project>.supabase.co
# VITE_OFFICE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=<publishable-client-key>
# In shared mode the browser uses authenticated Supabase PostgREST/RPC APIs,
# not the legacy /api/v1 prototype client or any local candidate storage.
# Officer login and membership provisioning remain with the authorized team.
